-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  dir_err_exeicon_decode.adam - Break step of dir_verinfo: an @exeicon
  file with the .ico extension that does not start with an icon directory
  (fixtures\dir_err_exeicon\text.ico, scripts\adam\make_dir_fixtures.py)
  is LK0007 at its path (BNF sec 2: an icon with no image the compiler can
  decode is an error at the path), exit 1, no exe
*******************************************************************************/

/*
@@test
  kind cli
  args "build" "--quiet" "<DIR>/dir_err_exeicon_decode.adam" "-o" "."
  exitcode 1
  | <DIR>/dir_err_exeicon_decode.adam(34,10): Error LK0007: @exeicon: '<DIR>/fixtures/dir_err_exeicon/text.ico' is no icon file: it does not start with an icon directory
@@end
*/

module exe dir_err_exeicon_decode;

@exeicon "$P:res/tests/exe/fixtures/dir_err_exeicon/text.ico";

begin
end.
